BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.10 0.20 0.40 rg 46 666 Td (1. Multi-User Lead Assignment Architecture:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 46 654 Td (Leads are linked to sales representatives via the relational mapping table 'lead_assignments'. Multiple representatives) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 46 642 Td (can simultaneously manage and collaborate on the same client company without data overwriting.) Tj ET

BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.10 0.20 0.40 rg 46 626 Td (2. Independent Task & Interaction Histories:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 46 614 Td (Each assigned user maintains their own independent 'LeadTask' instance and interaction log [Call, WhatsApp, Email].) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 46 602 Td (When one user is removed from a lead, it disappears from only that user's view while other assignees retain full access.) Tj ET

BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.10 0.20 0.40 rg 46 586 Td (3. Automated 24-Hour Follow-up Reminder Engine:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 46 574 Td (The system automatically computes reminder_date = next_followup_date - 1 day, delivering timely alerts.) Tj ET

