BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 44 296 Td (* When a lead is assigned to 3 users [Dhruvi, Juhi, Tech Admin], 3 separate records exist in the 'lead_tasks' table.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 44 284 Td (* Dhruvi can mark her task as Completed without impacting Juhi's pending follow-up.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 44 272 Td (* Follow-up dates and discussion agendas are isolated per user; each user sees only their own follow-up date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 44 260 Td (* If a user is unassigned via DELETE /api/leads/{id}/assignments/{uid}/, their task is soft-deleted [is_deleted=True].) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 44 248 Td (* If the user is re-assigned later, the existing task is seamlessly reactivated with full previous history intact.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 44 236 Td (* Admins can filter GET /api/tasks/?user_id={id} to inspect any representative's active pipeline.) Tj ET

